### 10.2 Fill `ROADMAP.md`

```markdown
# Roadmap

## v0.1 — MVP (done)

- [x] Parse Instagram export (saved + liked).
- [x] Store in SQLite.
- [x] Generate Markdown per post.
- [x] Basic keyword search.

## v0.2 — Better library

- [ ] Detect and report duplicate URLs across saved and liked.
- [ ] Rich filters: by creator, by date, by interaction.
- [ ] Export a single index Markdown file.
- [ ] Better error reporting on malformed exports.

## v0.3 — Enrichment (local)

- [ ] Download accessible media with `yt-dlp` (opt-in).
- [ ] Extract audio with `ffmpeg`.
- [ ] Transcribe with `whisper` (local model).
- [ ] Add transcript into each Markdown file.

## v0.4 — AI analysis

- [ ] Summarize each post.
- [ ] Extract key concepts and tools.
- [ ] Auto-categorize into topics.

## v0.5 — Search upgrade

- [ ] Full-text search with SQLite FTS5.
- [ ] Semantic search with local embeddings.

## v1.0 — Multi-provider

- [ ] Create `youtube-knowledge-lab`.
- [ ] Create `chrome-knowledge-lab`.
- [ ] Create `personal-knowledge-hub` for cross-provider search.